{"id": "s-0351", "domain": "web crawler", "names": [], "text": "I'm starting a fresh canvas for a web crawler. Create a blue rectangle called Seed at the top, then a gray circle called Queue below it. Connect Seed to the Queue with an arrow, because every URL gets queued. How many shapes do we have?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "blue", "name": "Seed", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray", "name": "Queue", "position": "below", "anchor": "Seed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Seed", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0352", "domain": "bike shop", "names": ["Frame", "Wheel", "Chain"], "text": "Duplicate the Wheel once, a bike needs two. Put the copy to the right of the original Wheel and colour it black. The Chain should be tiny and gray, and it touches the Frame, so link them. Can you tell me the nearest thing to the Frame?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Wheel"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "$new", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Wheel"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Chain", "size": "tiny", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Chain", "to": "Frame"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Frame", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0353", "domain": "incident response", "names": ["Alarm", "Oncall", "Postmortem"], "text": "When the Alarm goes off the Oncall engineer wakes up and later writes the Postmortem. Draw that sequence. Make the Alarm red and huge, since it ruins sleep. Then put the Postmortem at the bottom right. Is there any shape that is yellow?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alarm,Oncall,Postmortem", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alarm", "color": "red", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Postmortem", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "s-0354", "domain": "supermarket", "names": ["Dairy", "Bakery", "Checkout"], "text": "People enter and go first to Dairy, then to Bakery, and finally pay at Checkout. Wire that up, please. The Dairy aisle should be white. Bakery gets a nice orange. Honestly, make Checkout bigger since queues form there.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dairy,Bakery,Checkout", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dairy", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bakery", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Checkout"}}]}
{"id": "s-0355", "domain": "tax filing", "names": ["Form", "Audit", "Refund"], "text": "Form can lead to an Audit or to a Refund. Both are arrows out of Form. The Audit is red, the Refund green. Disconnect Form from Audit though, I am an optimist. What is Form connected to now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Form", "to": "Audit,Refund"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Audit", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Refund", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Form", "to": "Audit"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Form"}}]}
{"id": "s-0356", "domain": "chemistry lab", "names": ["Acid", "Base"], "text": "Acid and Base meet in a Beaker. Create a cyan ellipse called Beaker between them, and connect Acid to it and Base to it. Hmm, after thinking, make that beaker teal, not cyan. Does it have exactly two connections?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "teal", "name": "Beaker", "position": "between", "anchor": "Acid,Base"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Acid,Base", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "$new"}}]}
{"id": "s-0357", "domain": "train station", "names": ["Platform1", "Platform2", "Hall"], "text": "Put the Hall at the top, and both platforms below it. Make Platform1 left of Platform2. I need them aligned on the same horizontal line and equally spaced. Is Platform1 left of Platform2 now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hall", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Platform1", "position": "below", "anchor": "Hall"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Platform2", "position": "below", "anchor": "Hall"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Platform1", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Platform2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Platform1,Platform2", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Platform1,Platform2", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Platform1", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Platform2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0358", "domain": "board game", "names": ["Dice", "Token"], "text": "Okay so I'm designing a board game and I need a small hexagon in lime named Tile placed to the right of the Token. Then I want the Dice to be a white square. Hook the Token up to the new tile with a dashed line. Oh, and what shape is the Dice at this point?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "size": "small", "color": "lime", "name": "Tile", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Token"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dice", "shape": "square", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Token", "to": "$new", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Dice", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0359", "domain": "art museum", "names": ["Gallery1", "Gallery2", "Cafe"], "text": "Enlarge both galleries, visitors spend hours there. Colour Gallery1 purple and Gallery2 pink. Next, move the Cafe near Gallery2 and give it the label \"coffee\". Which is the biggest shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Gallery1,Gallery2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Gallery1", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Gallery2", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cafe", "position": "near", "anchor": "Gallery2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Cafe", "label": "coffee"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0360", "domain": "database", "names": ["Primary", "Replica1", "Replica2"], "text": "Primary replicates to both Replica1 and Replica2 with dashed arrows. Let me see: the Primary is navy and large. The replicas are gray. If one of them goes down, I will need to know the other, so tell me the degree of Primary.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Primary", "to": "Replica1,Replica2", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Primary", "color": "navy", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Replica1,Replica2", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Primary"}}]}
{"id": "s-0361", "domain": "school bus", "names": ["Depot", "Stop1", "Stop2", "School"], "text": "The bus leaves the Depot, stops at Stop1, then Stop2 and ends at the School. Chain all four. Stops are small yellow circles. School should be big and green. How many connections now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Depot,Stop1,Stop2,School", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Stop1,Stop2", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "School", "size": "large", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0362", "domain": "mood board", "names": ["Calm", "Joy", "Anger"], "text": "Calm is blue, Joy is yellow and Anger is red, no debate. Place Joy between Calm and Anger. Now make an orange star called Surprise near Joy, for the mood board.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Calm", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Joy", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Anger", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Joy", "position": "between", "anchor": "Calm,Anger"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "orange", "name": "Surprise", "position": "near", "anchor": "Joy"}}]}
{"id": "s-0363", "domain": "ad campaign", "names": ["Ad", "Click", "Lead"], "text": "The Ad gets a Click, the Click turns into a Lead. Connect with arrows. Lead is gold and huge. Remove the Ad when we finish. Okay, let me know how many shapes remain.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ad,Click,Lead", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lead", "color": "gold", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Ad"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0364", "domain": "playground", "names": ["Slide", "Swing", "Sandbox"], "text": "The kids love the Swing, so make it bigger and red. Place the Sandbox below the Slide, and make it yellow. Throw in 2 small green circles near the Swing, they're trees. How many circles are there?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Swing"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Swing", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sandbox", "position": "below", "anchor": "Slide"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sandbox", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "green", "count": "2", "position": "near", "anchor": "Swing"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0365", "domain": "api", "names": ["Req", "Resp"], "text": "Make the Req and Resp talk both ways, a single double-headed arrow between them. Put a small purple diamond named Cache between them too. Does the new diamond sit between Req and Resp?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Req", "to": "Resp", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "size": "small", "color": "purple", "name": "Cache", "position": "between", "anchor": "Req,Resp"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "position": "between", "anchor": "Req,Resp"}}]}
{"id": "s-0366", "domain": "astronomy club", "names": ["Telescope", "Moon", "Mars"], "text": "We're pointing the Telescope at the Moon tonight, then at Mars. So two dotted arrows, one to each. The Moon is white and Mars is red. Keep the Telescope at the bottom, please. Then tell me which target is closer to it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Telescope", "to": "Moon,Mars", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Moon", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mars", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Telescope", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Telescope", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0367", "domain": "hospital", "names": ["Er", "Surgery", "Recovery"], "text": "Er flows into Surgery, which flows into Recovery. Draw it. I want Recovery in green, Surgery in red, Er in white. And pull Recovery to the front. Is there a cycle? There better not be.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Er,Surgery,Recovery", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Recovery", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Surgery", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Er", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Recovery"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0368", "domain": "fashion", "names": ["Runway", "Model"], "text": "The model walks down the runway. Put the Model above the Runway, and make the Runway a huge rectangle. Add a gold star named Spotlight to the top left. Then link it to the Model with a dotted line. Last, what do you list near the Model?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Model", "position": "above", "anchor": "Runway"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Runway", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "gold", "name": "Spotlight", "position": "topLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Model", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "position": "near", "anchor": "Model"}}]}
{"id": "s-0369", "domain": "decision tree", "names": ["Root", "Yes", "No"], "text": "Root is a diamond, the question. Yes and No are the answers, so two arrows out of Root. Yes is green and No is red. Move No to the right of Yes. Is Yes connected to No?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Root", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Root", "to": "Yes,No"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Yes", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "No", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "No", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Yes"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Yes", "anchor": "No"}}]}
{"id": "s-0370", "domain": "stock room", "names": ["Shelf1", "Shelf2", "Shelf3"], "text": "Put the three shelves in a row, evenly spaced, and all of them gray. The middle one, Shelf2, is damaged, so colour it red instead. Describe Shelf2 to me when you are done.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Shelf1,Shelf2,Shelf3", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Shelf1,Shelf2,Shelf3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Shelf1,Shelf2,Shelf3", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Shelf2", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe", "target": "Shelf2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0371", "domain": "dungeon", "names": ["Entrance", "Trap", "Treasure"], "text": "From the Entrance you can reach the Trap or the Treasure. Connect Entrance to each. Make the trap a red triangle, the treasure a gold star. Then it's all too easy, so hide the Treasure behind the Trap by sending it to the back.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Entrance", "to": "Trap,Treasure"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Trap", "shape": "triangle", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Treasure", "shape": "star", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Treasure"}}]}
{"id": "s-0372", "domain": "user research", "names": ["Interview", "Survey", "Insight"], "text": "Interview and Survey both produce Insight. Make arrows from the first two to the third. The Insight should be a yellow star... I mean lime. Enlarge the Survey. And what are the neighbors of Insight?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Interview,Survey", "to": "Insight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Insight", "shape": "star", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Survey"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Insight"}}]}
{"id": "s-0373", "domain": "home theater", "names": ["Tv", "Speaker", "Sofa"], "text": "Sofa should face the Tv so put it below the Tv. The Speaker goes to the left of the Tv, and another speaker, a copy of it, goes right. Both speakers black. Is the Sofa below the Tv?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sofa", "position": "below", "anchor": "Tv"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Speaker", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Tv"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Speaker"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "$new", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Tv"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Speaker,$new", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Sofa", "position": "below", "anchor": "Tv"}}]}
{"id": "s-0374", "domain": "software", "names": ["Client", "Proxy", "Server"], "text": "The Client reaches the Server through the Proxy. Wire Client to Proxy and Proxy to Server. The Proxy is an orange hexagon. I'd also like a path check: from Client to Server, is there one?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Client,Proxy,Server", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Proxy", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Client", "to": "Server"}}]}
{"id": "s-0375", "domain": "music festival", "names": ["Main", "Tent", "Camp"], "text": "Put the Main stage in the middle and make it huge. The Tent goes to the left of it, the Camp to the right. Spread everything evenly on one line. The Camp is green. Tell me which shape is the leftmost.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Main", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Main", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tent", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Main"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Camp", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Main"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Camp", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0376", "domain": "genealogy", "names": ["Zed", "Yan"], "text": "Zed and Yan are siblings so I need a plain line between them. Make a magenta circle called Parent above Zed and connect it to Zed. Do the same for Yan. Is Parent the topmost thing?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Zed", "to": "Yan", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "magenta", "name": "Parent", "position": "above", "anchor": "Zed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Zed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Yan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "position": "top"}}]}
{"id": "s-0377", "domain": "emergency", "names": ["Alarm", "Stairs", "Exit"], "text": "Alarm, Stairs, Exit: the escape route. Use red arrows between each pair in order. The Exit is green and large, put it at the bottom. I'd like to know whether Exit is reachable from the Alarm.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alarm,Stairs,Exit", "pairing": "chain", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Exit", "color": "green", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Exit", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Alarm"}}]}
{"id": "s-0378", "domain": "taxonomy", "names": ["Animal", "Dog", "Cat", "Bird"], "text": "Animal is the parent of Dog, Cat and Bird. Draw the arrows down from Animal. Dog is brown, Cat is gray, Bird is yellow, ok? And what's the degree of Animal?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Animal", "to": "Dog,Cat,Bird"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dog", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cat", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bird", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Animal"}}]}
{"id": "s-0379", "domain": "snow day", "names": ["Snowman", "Hill"], "text": "Make three tiny white circles, those are snowballs, and put them near the Snowman. The Snowman is big, I'd go with large. Put the Hill at the bottom. Hmm, how many circles do I have?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "tiny", "color": "white", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Snowman"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Snowman", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hill", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0380", "domain": "nonprofit", "names": ["Donor", "Fund", "Project"], "text": "The Donor gives to the Fund and the Fund pays for the Project. Join them with arrows. Give the Fund a gold colour. The project is a hexagon, and tell me the rightmost shape.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Donor,Fund,Project", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fund", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Project", "shape": "hexagon"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0381", "domain": "fiber network", "names": ["Olt", "Splitter", "Home1", "Home2"], "text": "The Olt feeds the Splitter, and the Splitter feeds both homes. Chain Olt to Splitter, then link Splitter to Home1 and Home2. Make the Splitter a diamond. Both homes are lime. Is Home1 reachable from Olt?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Olt", "to": "Splitter"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Splitter", "to": "Home1,Home2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Splitter", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Home1,Home2", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Olt"}}]}
{"id": "s-0382", "domain": "survey", "names": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3"], "text": "Number the questions. Label Q1 with \"name\", Q2 with \"age\" and Q3 with \"city\". Put them in a column. And colour whichever one is the middle one yellow, that's Q2.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Q1", "label": "name"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Q2", "label": "age"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Q3", "label": "city"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Q1,Q2,Q3", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Q2", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "s-0383", "domain": "boat", "names": ["Sail", "Mast", "Hull"], "text": "The Sail hangs on the Mast, which stands on the Hull. Draw lines without arrows: Sail to Mast, Mast to Hull. The sail is a white triangle and the hull is a brown rectangle. How many shapes are brown?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sail,Mast,Hull", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sail", "shape": "triangle", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hull", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "brown"}}]}
{"id": "s-0384", "domain": "app", "names": ["Login", "Home"], "text": "Okay, so add a hexagon called Error in red next to Login and connect Login to it with a dashed arrow. Then connect Login to Home too, a solid one. Also shift the Home 90 pixels down. Is there anything that is red?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "red", "name": "Error", "position": "near", "anchor": "Login"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Login", "to": "$new", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Login", "to": "Home"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Home", "direction": "down", "distance": "90"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0385", "domain": "farm", "names": ["Barn", "Tractor"], "text": "Barn is large and red. Tractor is green, and it should stand to the left of Barn. Make two more tractors, I mean duplicate it twice. Then put everything in a column.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Barn", "size": "large", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tractor", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tractor", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Barn"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Tractor", "count": "2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "layout": "column"}}]}
{"id": "s-0386", "domain": "gym", "names": ["Treadmill", "Weights", "Mats"], "text": "Weights go next to the Mats. Treadmill sits in the top right corner. Make the Treadmill gray and huge, would you? And do you mind telling me what's nearest to the Weights?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Weights", "position": "near", "anchor": "Mats"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Treadmill", "position": "topRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Treadmill", "color": "gray", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Weights", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0387", "domain": "cloud", "names": ["Vpc", "Subnet", "Host"], "text": "Vpc contains Subnet, Subnet contains Host. Plain lines please, without arrows, and chain them. Make the Vpc large, the Host small. The Subnet should be teal. Which has the most connections?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Vpc,Subnet,Host", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Vpc", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Host", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Subnet", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0388", "domain": "fiction", "names": ["Alice", "Rabbit", "Queen"], "text": "Alice follows the Rabbit, and the Rabbit leads to the Queen. Two arrows. Make the Queen a huge red star... hmm, a heart doesn't exist here. And colour the Rabbit white. Alice is blue. Okay, is the Queen the biggest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alice,Rabbit,Queen", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Queen", "shape": "star", "size": "huge", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rabbit", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alice", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0389", "domain": "garage", "names": ["Car", "Lift", "Toolbox"], "text": "Lift the Car up, I mean move the Car above the Lift. The Toolbox should be on the right side, and red. Shrink the Lift a bit. Where is the Toolbox now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Car", "position": "above", "anchor": "Lift"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Toolbox", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Toolbox", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Lift"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Toolbox", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0390", "domain": "newsletter", "names": ["Write", "Edit", "Send"], "text": "Write, Edit, Send. Weekly routine. Make them a ring, a circle layout, with arrows from one to the next, and the Send going back to Write. That's three arrows. Does the cycle show up?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Write,Edit,Send", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Write,Edit,Send,Write", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0391", "domain": "train", "names": ["Engine", "Car1", "Car2"], "text": "The Engine pulls Car1, which pulls Car2. Just chain them with plain lines. Then align all three on a horizontal line. Car2 is the last one, so tell me whether it's the rightmost.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Engine,Car1,Car2", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Engine,Car1,Car2", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Car2", "position": "right"}}]}
{"id": "s-0392", "domain": "bookstore", "names": ["Fiction", "Poetry", "Cashier"], "text": "Make Poetry a tiny corner, in the bottom left, in purple. The Fiction section is the biggest. Put the Cashier right under Fiction and give it the label \"pay here\". What colour is Poetry?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Poetry", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Poetry", "size": "tiny", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fiction", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cashier", "position": "below", "anchor": "Fiction"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Cashier", "label": "pay here"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Poetry", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "s-0393", "domain": "mind map", "names": ["Goals"], "text": "I'm doing a goals mind map, only Goals is on there. Create 3 pink squares near it, then connect Goals to every new square. After that, enlarge the Goals node and tell me how many squares we have.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "color": "pink", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Goals"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Goals", "to": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest,shape=square)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Goals"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "s-0394", "domain": "hotel", "names": ["Reception", "Elevator", "Suite"], "text": "Reception to Elevator to Suite. Chain with arrows. I think the Suite should be a large gold hexagon. Please line the three up vertically too.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Reception,Elevator,Suite", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Suite", "shape": "hexagon", "size": "large", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Reception,Elevator,Suite", "axis": "vertical"}}]}
{"id": "s-0395", "domain": "debate", "names": ["Pro", "Con", "Judge"], "text": "Pro on the left, Con on the right, Judge between them, simple. Make Pro blue and Con red. Colour the Judge white and larger than the two. Is the Judge between Pro and Con?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Pro", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Con", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Judge", "position": "between", "anchor": "Pro,Con"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pro", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Con", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Judge", "color": "white", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Judge", "position": "between", "anchor": "Pro,Con"}}]}
{"id": "s-0396", "domain": "lighthouse", "names": ["Tower", "Beam", "Ship"], "text": "The Beam shines from the Tower to the Ship. Draw Tower to Beam, Beam to Ship, with dotted arrows. Beam is a yellow triangle. Ship is brown. Is the Ship the farthest from the Tower?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tower,Beam,Ship", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Beam", "shape": "triangle", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ship", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Tower", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0397", "domain": "freelance", "names": ["Pitch", "Contract", "Invoice"], "text": "My workflow: Pitch, Contract, Invoice. Chain them. Next, make everything blue except the Invoice, which should be green. Last, put the newest connection... no wait, bring Invoice to the front.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pitch,Contract,Invoice", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pitch,Contract", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Invoice", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Invoice"}}]}
{"id": "s-0398", "domain": "puzzle", "names": ["Start", "Goal"], "text": "Between Start and Goal there should be 4 small orange squares in a row. Create them. Then link Start to the oldest square and the Goal to the newest square. Finally describe the whole thing for me.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "small", "color": "orange", "count": "4", "position": "between", "anchor": "Start,Goal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=square)", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Start", "to": "mention(recency=oldest,shape=square)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Goal", "to": "mention(recency=newest,shape=square)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
{"id": "s-0399", "domain": "pets", "names": ["Fido", "Whiskers", "Tweety"], "text": "Fido is a brown circle. Whiskers is a gray circle. Tweety is a yellow circle, a tiny one. I want a list of all circles then. And remove the gray one.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Fido", "shape": "circle", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Whiskers", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Tweety", "shape": "circle", "color": "yellow", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(color=gray)"}}]}
{"id": "s-0400", "domain": "kitchen", "names": ["Sink", "Stove", "Table"], "text": "Table in the center please, and the Sink to the left, Stove to the right. Make the Table large and white. Distribute them evenly. What is the rightmost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Table", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sink", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Stove", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Table", "size": "large", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Sink,Table,Stove", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
